# Push after every update

After any feature, fix, or meaningful file change in this repo, create a git commit (when the user asked for work that should be saved) and `git push -u origin HEAD` to `git@github.com:Snl4/yeplanu.git`.

Do not commit `node_modules`, `data/`, `.env`, or secrets. Never force-push to main unless the user explicitly asks.
